WEBVTT

01:38.020 --> 01:40.710
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.210 --> 01:43.690
[Episode 34]

01:48.990 --> 01:53.979
[Guiyuan Hall]

02:12.000 --> 02:13.630
I, disciple Bai Zongying,

02:19.240 --> 02:21.370
request an audience with Sect Master.

02:24.120 --> 02:24.750
Yuanqi.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.310
Yuanqi.

02:28.750 --> 02:29.430
Yuanqi!

02:30.710 --> 02:31.240
Yuanqi.

02:31.710 --> 02:32.400
Senior...

02:33.310 --> 02:33.870
Se...

02:34.360 --> 02:34.910
Yuanqi!

02:35.590 --> 02:36.000
Se...

02:36.030 --> 02:36.750
Yuanqi.

02:37.079 --> 02:37.680
Senior...

02:44.680 --> 02:45.520
Yuanqi!

02:49.560 --> 02:50.310
Yuanqi...

05:01.720 --> 05:02.580
I'll leave now.

05:03.070 --> 05:04.720
After my heart transformation is complete,

05:04.720 --> 05:06.650
I'll go to Xin Xie Manor to find you.

05:06.720 --> 05:08.310
Once you arrive at Chongling Valley,

05:08.310 --> 05:09.640
make sure to write to me.

05:10.600 --> 05:11.120
Okay.

05:16.630 --> 05:17.490
Where's Sheng?

05:18.070 --> 05:19.480
We went through quite a lot together.

05:19.480 --> 05:20.240
We're leaving now,

05:20.240 --> 05:22.100
and she won't even come see us off?

05:24.190 --> 05:25.920
Why don't you go ask her?

05:26.800 --> 05:27.430
Forget it.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.270
Make sure to take good care of yourself

05:34.270 --> 05:35.470
and come back safely.

05:36.159 --> 05:36.920
You too.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.190
I'm off then.

06:05.120 --> 06:05.720
Sheng.

06:07.950 --> 06:08.540
Sheng?

06:10.800 --> 06:12.000
She was fine earlier.

06:12.160 --> 06:14.160
Why is she throwing a tantrum again?

06:15.120 --> 06:16.850
Come out now. They've all left.

06:18.510 --> 06:19.160
Sheng.

06:19.830 --> 06:20.760
Are you in there?

06:34.120 --> 06:34.720
Mrs. Li.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.050
Have you seen Sheng?

06:36.950 --> 06:37.830
No.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.190
Isn't she in the room?

06:40.310 --> 06:40.909
She's not.

06:41.390 --> 06:43.390
Maybe she went out.

06:43.560 --> 06:45.890
She'll probably be back in a little while.

06:54.820 --> 06:55.800
Once you get to Chongling Valley

06:55.800 --> 06:57.159
and complete the heart transformation,

06:57.159 --> 06:58.409
will you become an ordinary person

06:58.409 --> 06:59.540
without any powers?

07:00.630 --> 07:01.430
That's right.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.920
Then why not consider

07:05.680 --> 07:07.080
taking me as your master?

07:07.390 --> 07:08.240
I can pass on

07:08.270 --> 07:10.130
my awe-inspiring swordsmanship

07:10.240 --> 07:10.750
to you.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.360
That way, if you run into Sheng again
in the future,

07:13.360 --> 07:15.510
you won't have to put up with
her bullying.

07:15.510 --> 07:16.310
She wouldn't.

07:16.950 --> 07:17.950
You're that sure?

07:32.600 --> 07:33.930
What are you looking at?

07:35.000 --> 07:35.530
Nothing.

07:37.920 --> 07:39.510
Let's go rest up ahead for a bit.

07:39.510 --> 07:39.950
Okay.

08:03.070 --> 08:04.120
Sect Master.

08:04.630 --> 08:07.560
Bai Zongying has been locked up
in the back mountain.

08:12.480 --> 08:13.950
His martial arts have been crippled,

08:13.950 --> 08:15.880
and he knows our sect's grand plan.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.920
Why not eliminate him directly?

08:24.870 --> 08:26.000
We are not doing this

08:26.750 --> 08:28.210
to eliminate dissenters,

08:28.810 --> 08:30.370
but to find a way out

08:30.830 --> 08:32.760
for the entire Cultivation Realm.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.750
Bai is your senior.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.890
He may not understand it now,

08:36.890 --> 08:39.289
but he'll surely understand in the future.

08:40.440 --> 08:40.840
Yes.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.680
He'll understand sooner or later.

09:15.510 --> 09:17.910
They'll all understand.

09:33.200 --> 09:34.550
Once you become human,

09:35.150 --> 09:36.950
is there anywhere you want to go?

09:39.240 --> 09:40.040
You know what?

09:40.550 --> 09:42.270
I've traveled far and wide
these past years,

09:42.270 --> 09:44.200
and I've been to quite a few places.

09:44.250 --> 09:45.360
The starlight in the northern desert

09:45.360 --> 09:47.290
is sparse, quiet, and mysterious,

09:47.630 --> 09:50.120
and the auroras there feel like a dream.

09:51.360 --> 09:53.510
The Juyong Mountain in the southeast
is also good—

09:53.510 --> 09:55.870
the peak is towering,
piercing straight into the clouds.

09:55.870 --> 09:56.550
The most stunning of all

09:56.550 --> 09:59.000
is the waterfall
cascading down the mountain.

09:59.000 --> 10:00.460
Its force is overwhelming

10:00.750 --> 10:02.880
and unforgettable at a single glance.

10:03.270 --> 10:04.270
Once you recover,

10:04.600 --> 10:06.390
I'll take you to see them one by one.

10:06.390 --> 10:08.120
We can also ask Xin Mei and Sheng

10:08.240 --> 10:09.640
to join us on the journey.

10:11.550 --> 10:12.150
Thank you.

10:13.550 --> 10:14.350
It's nothing.

10:14.750 --> 10:15.720
Isn't the point of being friends

10:15.720 --> 10:17.920
just to enjoy the liveliness together?

10:18.360 --> 10:18.960
By the way,

10:19.360 --> 10:20.840
have you been to any of the places

10:20.840 --> 10:21.840
I just mentioned?

10:23.320 --> 10:25.270
I've never been to Juyong Mountain.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.200
But I heard

10:26.560 --> 10:27.550
there's a kind of spiritual herb there

10:27.550 --> 10:29.000
called Hindu Datura.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.510
If combined with aconite root,

10:30.510 --> 10:32.030
it can be made into a narcotic

10:32.030 --> 10:33.870
that causes full-body paralysis

10:33.870 --> 10:35.630
and unconsciousness for 10 days straight.

10:35.630 --> 10:36.360
No matter how profound

10:36.360 --> 10:37.490
your cultivation is

10:37.630 --> 10:39.090
or how strong your body is,

10:39.390 --> 10:40.520
you can't resist it.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.550
Is it really that powerful?

10:43.550 --> 10:44.200
Of course.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.390
I put that kind of narcotic

10:46.390 --> 10:47.320
in this wine.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.840
Dare to try it?

10:55.440 --> 10:56.390
Sure. Why not?

11:03.120 --> 11:04.780
It doesn't seem to have any...

11:07.910 --> 11:09.670
You're actually serious?

11:16.790 --> 11:17.510
Let me

11:18.360 --> 11:19.690
walk this road on my own.

11:22.270 --> 11:23.530
Let's hurry back home.

11:24.550 --> 11:27.750
I'll come to your place for
the full-month celebration another day.

11:27.750 --> 11:28.790
Look at you, saying it like that.

11:28.790 --> 11:29.600
Do you remember last time, you...

11:29.600 --> 11:30.120
Look.

11:32.360 --> 11:32.890
Let's go.

11:34.240 --> 11:34.840
Sir?

11:35.240 --> 11:35.790
Sir.

11:38.030 --> 11:38.550
Sir.

11:39.150 --> 11:40.390
-Sir?
-Wake up, Sir.

11:41.510 --> 11:42.360
Sir, wake up.

11:42.720 --> 11:43.320
Sir.

11:45.390 --> 11:46.850
What happened to this guy?

11:47.510 --> 11:48.840
He was probably bitten

11:48.840 --> 11:50.080
by a venomous snake in the grass.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.880
This won't do.

11:50.910 --> 11:51.870
He could die.

11:53.910 --> 11:54.770
How about this?

11:55.030 --> 11:55.960
Let's lend him a hand

11:55.960 --> 11:56.510
and carry him to

11:56.510 --> 11:57.720
Mr. Liu's house in the village.

11:57.720 --> 11:58.910
He's been trekking in the mountains
for years.

11:58.910 --> 11:59.790
He's skilled at treating this.

11:59.790 --> 12:00.120
Okay.

12:00.240 --> 12:00.700
Come on.

12:01.480 --> 12:01.940
Come on.

12:40.030 --> 12:40.690
Put it here.

12:42.670 --> 12:43.270
Xin Mei.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.630
Dinner's almost ready.

12:44.630 --> 12:45.750
Where are you going?

12:45.750 --> 12:46.720
I'm going to look for Sheng.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.440
You guys eat first.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.640
No need to wait for us.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.410
I'll save some for you.

13:37.630 --> 13:38.490
Who is this guy?

13:38.510 --> 13:39.870
Coming to visit our sect at this hour.

13:39.870 --> 13:41.930
Doesn't he even check what time it is?

13:42.080 --> 13:42.960
Who knows?

14:16.760 --> 14:17.790
State your identity.

14:17.790 --> 14:19.320
Do you have a visiting card?

14:20.320 --> 14:20.980
Stop there!

14:24.120 --> 14:25.550
From which sect do you come?

14:25.550 --> 14:26.410
What brings you

14:26.720 --> 14:27.920
to our Tianyuan Sect?

14:33.500 --> 14:37.020
[Tianyuan Sect]

14:38.680 --> 14:39.710
Sect Master

14:40.000 --> 14:41.400
has allowed you to enter.

15:09.360 --> 15:10.160
What, scared?

15:12.480 --> 15:13.320
It's too late.

15:41.020 --> 15:42.410
Danger. Danger!

15:59.320 --> 15:59.870
Sheng?

16:01.600 --> 16:02.240
Sheng!

16:13.360 --> 16:14.030
Sheng!

16:14.790 --> 16:16.050
Sheng, what happened?

16:16.270 --> 16:16.910
Sheng!

16:18.030 --> 16:19.290
Sheng, what happened?

16:24.890 --> 16:25.790
The Void Stage?

16:44.900 --> 16:45.620
Senior.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.880
Sheng, wake up.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.349
Sheng.

17:22.030 --> 17:23.000
Wake up.

17:55.000 --> 17:56.800
You actually dare to come again.

17:58.270 --> 18:00.400
A cultivator at the Deity Transformation Stage
wants to see me.

18:00.400 --> 18:01.800
I wouldn't dare not come.

18:02.240 --> 18:03.920
You know my cultivation level,

18:03.920 --> 18:05.720
yet you still dare to come alone.

18:06.070 --> 18:07.670
You've got quite some nerve.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.880
For someone like you,

18:10.030 --> 18:11.400
whether I avoid you or not

18:11.400 --> 18:12.600
makes no difference.

18:13.200 --> 18:15.460
You're quite clear-headed, aren't you?

18:16.160 --> 18:17.640
I just know my own limits.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.200
May I ask, sir,

18:19.880 --> 18:20.880
for what purpose

18:21.440 --> 18:23.170
have you summoned me this time?

18:24.000 --> 18:25.720
For what purpose?

18:26.110 --> 18:27.910
You actually dare to ask me that?

18:28.830 --> 18:30.240
That old scoundrel Su Taiyi

18:30.240 --> 18:31.900
was your disciple, wasn't he?

18:32.110 --> 18:34.400
He used the excuse of refining
the Immortality Pills

18:34.400 --> 18:35.730
to deceive us for years,

18:36.310 --> 18:37.070
causing us to waste enormous

18:37.070 --> 18:39.000
manpower and material resources.

18:39.000 --> 18:41.480
Now everything has fallen apart.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.820
He died and walked away clean,

18:43.830 --> 18:45.590
but what about the debt he owed us?

18:45.590 --> 18:47.250
How do you intend to settle it?

18:51.070 --> 18:53.200
As for what each sect has contributed,

18:53.240 --> 18:55.310
the records have been kept
in the books of Chongling Valley.

18:55.310 --> 18:57.570
On the day Su Taiyi suddenly passed away,

18:58.270 --> 18:59.480
everyone was filled with resentment

18:59.480 --> 19:00.480
and parted on bad terms.

19:00.480 --> 19:01.240
There was indeed

19:01.240 --> 19:02.590
no suitable opportunity

19:02.590 --> 19:04.590
to properly discuss the aftermath.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.200
Now that I've come here today,

19:06.200 --> 19:07.530
I can tell you guys this:

19:08.110 --> 19:09.110
Chongling Valley

19:09.310 --> 19:10.960
will not default on what it owes anyone.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.000
You are welcome

19:12.000 --> 19:13.110
to go to Chongling Valley at any time
to audit the accounts.

19:13.110 --> 19:15.160
Once the accounts
are verified and settled,

19:15.160 --> 19:17.160
you may take back all your
funds, treasures,

19:17.160 --> 19:19.760
and spiritual herbs
to your respective sects.

19:19.830 --> 19:21.000
Your 2 wayward disciples

19:21.000 --> 19:22.790
in North Xiang and Xin Xie Manor

19:23.400 --> 19:24.440
helped those demonic path cultivators

19:24.440 --> 19:25.720
of Wushuang Society

19:26.070 --> 19:27.720
persecute disciples of
our righteous sects.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.850
And how do you intend

19:28.960 --> 19:29.820
to settle this?

19:31.550 --> 19:32.640
In Sihe Library,

19:33.070 --> 19:33.750
there was indeed a minor conflict

19:33.750 --> 19:35.070
between our 2 sides.

19:35.950 --> 19:36.780
However, when your disciples

19:36.780 --> 19:38.160
were trapped by the Qinghong Sect,

19:38.160 --> 19:39.510
it was also I who rescued them

19:39.510 --> 19:40.550
One favor and one grievance—

19:40.550 --> 19:41.920
these should cancel each other out.

19:41.920 --> 19:43.480
Bai Zongying is the person
directly involved.

19:43.480 --> 19:44.550
He knows the full sequence of events

19:44.550 --> 19:45.480
from beginning to end.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.160
If you wish to

19:46.160 --> 19:47.290
clarify the matter,

19:47.550 --> 19:48.880
you may summon him here.

20:00.400 --> 20:02.370
Then what about
the countless wronged souls of our sect

20:02.370 --> 20:04.720
who were slaughtered or injured
in the Battle of Pinghu?

20:04.720 --> 20:06.780
How do you intend to account for that?

20:08.200 --> 20:10.400
Can you—a remnant of the War Demons—

20:10.790 --> 20:12.190
ever settle these debts?

20:24.030 --> 20:25.400
So you all already knew.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.620
Remnants of the War Demons

20:27.680 --> 20:30.210
must be killed by anyone
who encounters them!

20:30.590 --> 20:33.110
"Must be killed by anyone
who encounters them?"

20:33.110 --> 20:34.310
You may not know this,

20:34.920 --> 20:35.980
but my body carries

20:36.510 --> 20:37.830
half human blood.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.070
My father

20:39.400 --> 20:41.160
was a cultivator from an immortal sect.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.310
So within my body

20:42.550 --> 20:44.030
flows both War Demon

20:44.110 --> 20:45.370
and human bloodlines.

20:46.310 --> 20:46.790
All these years,

20:46.790 --> 20:48.590
I've been wandering among the Human Race

20:48.590 --> 20:50.190
with my identity concealed,

20:50.790 --> 20:51.680
fearing that

20:51.790 --> 20:53.350
once it was exposed,

20:53.680 --> 20:55.810
it would bring about a deadly calamity

20:56.160 --> 20:57.550
and even trigger war
between our two races,

20:57.550 --> 20:59.350
deepening the grievances between us.

20:59.350 --> 21:01.310
I'm powerless to change this outcome.

21:01.310 --> 21:02.240
If you all still believe

21:02.240 --> 21:03.640
that I'm gravely guilty,

21:04.480 --> 21:05.880
then I have no defense to offer.

21:05.880 --> 21:06.810
I came here today

21:07.880 --> 21:09.140
with only one request:

21:16.070 --> 21:16.830
this matter

21:17.510 --> 21:18.440
has nothing to do

21:18.880 --> 21:20.540
with Xin Mei and Xin Xie Manor.

21:20.830 --> 21:22.030
If there's any hatred or resentment,

21:22.030 --> 21:23.490
please direct it all at me.

21:24.000 --> 21:26.660
I'm willing to
bear all responsibility myself.

21:55.440 --> 21:56.240
Senior?

22:00.000 --> 22:00.640
Senior.

22:01.200 --> 22:01.830
Senior!

22:03.680 --> 22:04.240
Senior!

22:05.070 --> 22:05.830
Senior!

22:08.720 --> 22:09.480
Senior.

22:10.160 --> 22:10.760
Senior...

22:11.030 --> 22:11.830
Senior!

22:33.510 --> 22:34.350
What happened?

22:34.350 --> 22:35.590
Bring wound healing ointment,
hemostatic pills,

22:35.590 --> 22:36.550
and a pot of hot water!

22:36.550 --> 22:37.080
Be quick!

22:37.350 --> 22:38.000
Go, hurry!

22:41.270 --> 22:41.680
Here.

23:01.680 --> 23:02.510
How is she?

23:05.030 --> 23:06.560
She's out of danger for now,

23:06.680 --> 23:08.000
but she won't last much longer.

23:08.000 --> 23:08.480
Then...

23:08.550 --> 23:10.350
Then we need to take her to a doctor
as soon as possible.

23:10.350 --> 23:11.970
Lu Qianqiao knows someone
in Chongling Valley.

23:11.970 --> 23:12.970
Let's set off for

23:13.000 --> 23:14.070
Chongling Valley right away.

23:14.070 --> 23:15.550
I destroyed Senior's Qihai

23:15.550 --> 23:17.310
and pierced her heart meridians.

23:17.310 --> 23:18.830
Even if she manages to hold on
until we get to Chongling Valley,

23:18.830 --> 23:20.200
she's still doomed to die.

23:20.200 --> 23:22.000
You were the one who injured her?

23:24.200 --> 23:25.350
Take care of Senior for me.

23:25.350 --> 23:26.270
I'll be back soon.

23:26.270 --> 23:27.160
Where are you going?

23:27.160 --> 23:28.690
To find someone to save her.

23:37.790 --> 23:43.430
[Jingxing Residence]

23:53.830 --> 23:54.690
This residence

23:54.960 --> 23:56.690
has been vacant for a long time.

23:56.790 --> 23:57.990
We just cleaned it up.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.570
Make do with it for now.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.750
Who was

24:06.200 --> 24:07.550
the previous owner of this room?

24:07.550 --> 24:08.030
No idea.

24:08.710 --> 24:09.790
Ever since I entered the sect,

24:09.790 --> 24:11.640
this Jingxing Residence has been empty.

24:11.640 --> 24:12.310
I heard that

24:12.310 --> 24:13.750
an elder used to live here,

24:13.750 --> 24:15.880
but he passed away long ago.

25:51.920 --> 25:53.030
This is a piece

25:53.310 --> 25:54.830
your father liked a lot.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.990
Have you heard it before?

26:00.350 --> 26:01.680
His name was Lu Jingran.

26:02.680 --> 26:03.680
He was my junior.

26:04.920 --> 26:05.720
Back then,

26:06.160 --> 26:07.560
he was ordered by the Sect

26:08.750 --> 26:10.150
to approach your mother.

26:12.350 --> 26:13.950
He had been searching for you

26:14.480 --> 26:15.790
until the day he died.

26:16.920 --> 26:17.880
To you,

26:18.370 --> 26:20.550
he may not have been a responsible father;

26:20.550 --> 26:21.410
to your mother,

26:21.550 --> 26:22.310
he wasn't necessarily

26:22.310 --> 26:23.570
a good husband either.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.790
But to the Human Race

26:25.110 --> 26:26.170
and Tianyuan Sect,

26:26.480 --> 26:27.610
he was a man of merit.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.270
You've been in the mortal world for years.

26:30.270 --> 26:32.800
You should be able to
understand that, right?

26:33.680 --> 26:34.510
In this world,

26:35.200 --> 26:36.060
nothing exists

26:36.350 --> 26:37.590
in isolation.

26:38.480 --> 26:41.080
It's also true when it comes to
love and hatred.

26:41.400 --> 26:42.960
He was first a member of the Human Race,

26:42.960 --> 26:44.760
a disciple of the Tianyuan Sect,

26:44.880 --> 26:46.880
and only after that was he my father.

26:47.240 --> 26:48.170
I don't blame him

26:48.440 --> 26:49.110
for that.

26:53.110 --> 26:54.310
I've heard your power

26:54.640 --> 26:56.370
has been gradually declining,

26:56.920 --> 26:58.640
and you've been using the method of
shedding skin,

26:58.640 --> 26:59.640
replacing flesh,

26:59.960 --> 27:00.890
renewing bones,

27:01.160 --> 27:01.960
purifying blood,

27:01.960 --> 27:03.310
and transforming the heart

27:03.310 --> 27:05.570
to break the Curse of Five Deficiencies?

27:05.640 --> 27:06.500
Sect Leader Li,

27:07.000 --> 27:09.000
what's your purpose in asking this?

27:09.270 --> 27:10.400
Believe it or not,

27:10.920 --> 27:11.960
I mean no harm.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.840
You're Jingran's child,

27:14.110 --> 27:15.570
which makes you my nephew.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.440
Even now.

27:17.030 --> 27:19.640
you still retain the cultivation of
the Foundation Establishment Stage.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.110
It shows that at your peak,

27:22.240 --> 27:23.590
you were already close to

27:23.590 --> 27:25.650
the threshold of a perfect War Demon.

27:26.090 --> 27:27.150
Your innate talent

27:27.160 --> 27:28.720
far surpasses your mother's.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.180
To give up such a high level

27:30.640 --> 27:32.370
of cultivation just like that—

27:32.590 --> 27:33.920
don't you find it a pity?

27:35.590 --> 27:36.920
Compared to immortality

27:36.920 --> 27:38.120
and boundless power,

27:38.730 --> 27:39.560
I would rather

27:39.590 --> 27:40.850
live more like a human.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.750
To live under that curse,

27:43.310 --> 27:44.350
an endless life

27:45.070 --> 27:46.480
is nothing but a Purgatory—

27:46.480 --> 27:47.410
pure suffering.

27:47.790 --> 27:49.190
So that's what you think?

27:50.160 --> 27:51.360
Then you might as well

27:51.640 --> 27:52.640
wait a bit longer.

27:53.110 --> 27:54.440
What do you mean by that?

27:54.550 --> 27:56.150
Exactly what it sounds like.

27:57.550 --> 27:59.150
The world is ever-changing.

27:59.640 --> 28:02.070
Don't rush into
making important decisions.

28:02.070 --> 28:02.880
Wait a bit,

28:03.590 --> 28:06.190
and perhaps there will be
a turn for the better.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.940
Before, your cultivation was stagnant,

28:22.070 --> 28:23.000
so you wanted to go back to live in

28:23.000 --> 28:24.060
Wei County with me.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.170
But now that

28:25.400 --> 28:27.310
you've reached the Nascent Soul Stage,

28:27.310 --> 28:28.840
have you changed your mind?

28:29.270 --> 28:29.830
No.

28:30.510 --> 28:31.270
I still want to

28:31.270 --> 28:32.750
go back to live in Wei County with you.

28:32.750 --> 28:34.030
And I've already thought it through.

28:34.030 --> 28:35.510
Since you're skilled in medicine,

28:35.510 --> 28:36.960
we can open a clinic together.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.000
We'll work when the sun rises

28:38.000 --> 28:39.160
and rest when it sets.

28:39.160 --> 28:40.400
You'll treat and save patients,

28:40.400 --> 28:41.160
and I'll be right beside you,

28:41.160 --> 28:42.090
helping you out.

28:43.510 --> 28:44.400
If anything big happens

28:44.400 --> 28:45.800
in the Cultivation Realm

28:45.830 --> 28:46.480
that may endanger

28:46.480 --> 28:47.400
many lives,

28:48.510 --> 28:49.440
will you step in?

28:49.480 --> 28:50.030
I will.

28:51.510 --> 28:52.310
That certain?

28:53.830 --> 28:54.760
As a cultivator,

28:55.070 --> 28:56.200
the cultivation I possess

28:56.200 --> 28:57.920
comes from the blessings of this world

28:57.920 --> 28:59.720
and the support of the common people.

28:59.720 --> 29:00.800
I can't just take

29:00.830 --> 29:02.030
without giving back.

29:02.030 --> 29:02.640
Moreover,

29:02.960 --> 29:04.440
protecting the peace of the world

29:04.440 --> 29:06.030
is our duty as cultivators.

29:06.440 --> 29:06.920
So

29:07.480 --> 29:09.640
no matter what happens
in the Cultivation Realm,

29:09.640 --> 29:12.240
I won't stand aside
and look after only myself.

29:13.510 --> 29:14.310
I see.

29:24.680 --> 29:26.880
Don't you want to be an ordinary person?

29:26.960 --> 29:28.220
So why do you still need

29:28.240 --> 29:29.500
this Sunblock Banner?

29:29.510 --> 29:30.720
This trip back to the Central Plains

29:30.720 --> 29:31.780
is unpredictable.

29:32.400 --> 29:33.000
This thing

29:33.750 --> 29:34.750
may come in handy.

29:35.680 --> 29:38.000
The Sunblock Banner was forged
by heretical cultivators.

29:38.000 --> 29:40.510
It draws its power
by devouring essence blood.

29:40.510 --> 29:42.720
Before, you used your War Demon blood
as a sacrifice.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.350
Although you defeated the Master,

29:44.350 --> 29:46.000
the bloodline power in your body

29:46.000 --> 29:47.750
was almost completely drained.

29:47.750 --> 29:49.000
If you use it again in the future,

29:49.000 --> 29:50.260
the power it unleashes

29:50.270 --> 29:51.640
will be greatly reduced,

29:51.640 --> 29:52.500
and you may even

29:52.720 --> 29:54.350
suffer a severe backlash.

29:55.960 --> 29:56.550
I know.

30:40.070 --> 30:40.640
Senior.

30:40.960 --> 30:41.550
Senior.

30:42.440 --> 30:43.750
I didn't see the new sword technique

30:43.750 --> 30:45.070
we learned today clearly.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.000
Can you teach me?

30:46.440 --> 30:47.510
You didn't pay attention
when you were supposed to learn it,

30:47.510 --> 30:48.480
and now you're panicking?

30:48.480 --> 30:49.640
Carry 10 more buckets of water tomorrow,

30:49.640 --> 30:50.440
and I'll teach you.

30:50.440 --> 30:51.310
Thank you, Senior.

30:51.310 --> 30:53.440
I'll definitely study hard tomorrow.

31:01.590 --> 31:02.480
Isn't dinner being served

31:02.480 --> 31:03.240
late tonight?

31:03.240 --> 31:03.920
No idea.

31:04.030 --> 31:05.290
I'm already starving.

31:05.440 --> 31:06.640
Why don't we go check?

31:06.720 --> 31:07.780
Let's go. Hurry up.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.240
Yuanqi.

31:21.030 --> 31:22.110
I told you long ago

31:23.040 --> 31:23.920
that nothing good would come

31:23.920 --> 31:25.580
from following Bai Zongying,

31:25.960 --> 31:27.360
but you wouldn't listen.

31:27.750 --> 31:29.640
It was like you thought
I was trying to harm you.

31:29.640 --> 31:30.720
Don't talk nonsense.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.720
Senior Yuanqi fell to his own death.

31:32.790 --> 31:34.240
It had nothing to do with anything else.

31:34.240 --> 31:35.440
Fell to his own death?

31:36.720 --> 31:38.050
Who would believe that?

31:38.590 --> 31:39.590
Do you believe it?

31:39.830 --> 31:40.640
Or do you?

31:42.920 --> 31:44.050
Where is Senior Bai?

31:44.480 --> 31:46.140
I haven't seen him for a while.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.560
He didn't even show up for

31:47.680 --> 31:49.110
Yuanqi's 21st-day
memorial joss paper-burning.

31:49.110 --> 31:49.750
No idea.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.930
He can go wherever he wants.

31:52.030 --> 31:53.490
It's none of our business.

32:02.240 --> 32:03.370
Where is Senior Bai?

32:04.160 --> 32:05.640
He didn't reply to the letters
I wrote him,

32:05.640 --> 32:06.270
and I haven't even seen him

32:06.270 --> 32:07.930
since I arrived a few days ago.

32:08.110 --> 32:08.720
No idea.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.330
You're handling
the sect's internal affairs

32:10.330 --> 32:11.370
in his place now.

32:11.720 --> 32:13.160
He's a living person,
not someone who can just vanish.

32:13.160 --> 32:15.160
How could you not know where he went?

32:15.750 --> 32:17.790
He went down the mountain
for some errands.

32:17.790 --> 32:19.640
Senior Bai has lost
his immortal perception

32:19.640 --> 32:20.640
and all his power.

32:20.960 --> 32:23.360
What kind of errands
could he possibly run?

32:24.030 --> 32:26.640
Even trash has its uses.

32:27.830 --> 32:29.290
Who are you calling trash?

32:31.830 --> 32:33.070
Tianyuan Sect is not a place

32:33.070 --> 32:34.330
where you can run wild.

32:34.350 --> 32:35.750
If you dare keep pestering me,

32:35.750 --> 32:37.400
I'll cripple you right now.

32:48.200 --> 32:48.930
Who's there?

33:29.310 --> 33:30.240
I'm Lu Qianqiao.

33:37.480 --> 33:38.400
Why are you here?

33:38.400 --> 33:39.750
Were you captured and brought here?

33:39.750 --> 33:42.010
Was your identity as a War Demon exposed?

33:42.160 --> 33:43.290
My matters can wait.

33:43.720 --> 33:45.250
I need to ask you something.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.930
What happened to Bai Zongying?

33:48.720 --> 33:51.250
So the one secretly spying last night
was you?

33:52.350 --> 33:53.410
Please believe me.

33:53.790 --> 33:55.850
I absolutely have no ill intentions.

33:59.880 --> 34:01.140
About half a month ago,

34:01.510 --> 34:02.270
I wrote 3 letters in a row

34:02.270 --> 34:03.310
to Senior Bai,

34:03.720 --> 34:05.400
but he didn't reply to any of them.

34:05.400 --> 34:06.200
I was worried about his safety.

34:06.200 --> 34:07.600
so I rushed here to check,

34:07.940 --> 34:09.070
but I didn't see him.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.030
The disciples of Tianyuan Sect

34:11.030 --> 34:13.889
all said he went down the mountain
for some errands.

34:14.550 --> 34:15.480
Do you believe them?

34:15.480 --> 34:16.280
Of course not.

34:16.710 --> 34:18.880
Senior Bai had his immortal perception
dug out.

34:18.880 --> 34:21.540
What urgent matter
could he possibly go handle?

34:21.659 --> 34:23.920
Besides, he didn't take anything
with him.

34:23.920 --> 34:25.550
Setting aside everything else,

34:25.550 --> 34:27.000
he even left behind the Sun Splendor,

34:27.000 --> 34:28.860
which he always carried with him.

34:30.070 --> 34:30.840
He had

34:30.870 --> 34:32.400
a very loyal junior by his side

34:32.400 --> 34:33.199
named Yuanqi.

34:34.000 --> 34:34.800
He's dead too.

34:37.030 --> 34:37.830
How did he die?

34:39.800 --> 34:41.260
Everyone in Tianyuan Sect

34:41.400 --> 34:42.590
is tight-lipped about it.

34:42.590 --> 34:44.110
They all say he fell to his death.

34:44.110 --> 34:45.570
How is that even possible?

34:47.320 --> 34:48.520
You think this matter

34:49.000 --> 34:51.199
has something to do with Tianyuan Sect?

34:52.650 --> 34:53.760
My mind is in a mess.

34:54.670 --> 34:55.730
I can't sort it out.

35:00.110 --> 35:01.370
So where are you going?

35:02.150 --> 35:03.400
I'm going back to the Sect

35:03.400 --> 35:04.660
to ask Master for help.

35:05.960 --> 35:08.070
Your master is
the Sect Leader of Lingji Mountain.

35:08.070 --> 35:09.710
Can he really interfere in
Tianyuan Sect's affairs?

35:09.710 --> 35:11.660
It's still better than
just waiting here helplessly,

35:11.660 --> 35:14.660
letting Tianyuan Sect feed me excuses
and placate me.

35:16.230 --> 35:16.960
If something really happened

35:16.960 --> 35:17.960
to Bai Zongying,

35:18.400 --> 35:19.480
there are only 2 possibilities

35:19.480 --> 35:20.940
of his current situation:

35:21.510 --> 35:22.510
either he's dead,

35:22.840 --> 35:23.480
or

35:23.960 --> 35:25.360
he's being held captive.

35:28.230 --> 35:30.550
Based on what you know
about Tianyuan Sect,

35:30.550 --> 35:31.550
where do you think

35:32.320 --> 35:33.450
they would keep him?

36:10.710 --> 36:11.840
I, disciple Jin Lun,

36:11.840 --> 36:13.370
come up the mountain today,

36:13.840 --> 36:16.440
willing to abandon
all material possessions,

36:16.760 --> 36:18.320
sever worldly ties,

36:19.400 --> 36:20.800
and accept all trials

36:21.810 --> 36:23.010
to prove my Dao heart.

36:43.180 --> 36:45.000
The first precept of Tianyin Mountain:

36:45.000 --> 36:46.760
shedding gold and silver from the body.

36:46.760 --> 36:48.290
Greed entangles the heart;

36:48.720 --> 36:50.360
when the heart cannot be transcended,

36:50.360 --> 36:52.420
the person cannot transcend either.

37:14.150 --> 37:16.000
The second precept of Tianyin Mountain:

37:16.000 --> 37:17.330
the path of compassion.

37:17.550 --> 37:18.480
Pity all things.

37:29.130 --> 37:31.530
Living beings grant me essence and spirit,

37:31.670 --> 37:33.800
and I shall repay them with my own body.

38:30.320 --> 38:32.520
The third precept of Tianyin Mountain:

38:33.030 --> 38:35.030
abandoning worldly distractions.

38:35.960 --> 38:37.670
All beings are within my sight;

38:37.670 --> 38:38.930
all things are as dust.

38:52.030 --> 38:52.830
Didn't you say

38:53.320 --> 38:56.850
once you saw me, you wouldn't
want to go up the mountain anymore?

38:58.550 --> 39:00.410
After our parting in North Xiang,

39:00.590 --> 39:02.790
I didn't know if we'd cross paths again.

39:28.110 --> 39:29.440
Now that you've seen me,

39:31.820 --> 39:33.020
what do you plan to do?

40:15.400 --> 40:17.400
Are you still going up the mountain?

40:20.190 --> 40:21.320
Are you going or not?

40:25.060 --> 40:26.190
Are you going or not?

40:27.510 --> 40:29.640
You don't want me to go up the mountain?

40:31.840 --> 40:32.500
No, I don't.

40:37.670 --> 40:38.730
Then I'm not going.

40:39.270 --> 40:40.850
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪

40:40.870 --> 40:43.140
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

40:43.670 --> 40:47.050
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

40:47.220 --> 40:48.740
♪ I believe I'm innocent ♪

40:48.760 --> 40:54.070
♪ Turned into dust and scattered away ♪

40:54.830 --> 40:56.420
♪ I accept the blame of
numerous accusations ♪

40:56.450 --> 40:58.910
♪ I offer no defense ♪

40:58.930 --> 41:02.410
♪ I accept this as my only choice ♪

41:02.430 --> 41:04.070
♪ I admit my heart
is as hard as iron and stone ♪

41:04.100 --> 41:06.380
♪ Call me cold if you must ♪

41:06.510 --> 41:09.130
♪ Until I die ♪

41:09.670 --> 41:12.880
♪ I accept this trial of love
fate has given me ♪

41:13.110 --> 41:17.540
♪ I take in both love and hate alike ♪

42:37.960 --> 42:38.590
Your meal.

43:00.800 --> 43:01.730
I'm Lu Qianqiao.

43:03.760 --> 43:04.620
What happened?

43:07.030 --> 43:09.240
Lord Baori of Qinghong Sect is here.

43:12.600 --> 43:13.810
Qinghong Sect

43:14.670 --> 43:15.960
really is backed by Tianyuan Sect.
